---
import Hero from "@/components/blocks/Hero.astro";
import site from "@/config/site";
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title={site.meta.title} description={site.meta.description}>
	<div class="animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-4 mx-auto max-w-2xl p-8 md:p-16">
		<Hero />

<section class="mt-12 space-y-5">
	<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">
		About Me
	</h2>

	<p class="text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
		I've always had a strong interest in technology and how it can be used to
		solve problems, make life easier and explore new possibilities. I enjoy
		working with Python, SQL and automation, alongside exploring data analytics,
		machine learning, and both cloud-based and locally hosted AI models.
	</p>

	<p class="text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
		This website is a place to share my interests, what I'm learning and a few
		things I've been working on along the way.
	</p>

	<p class="text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
		Outside of technology, I'm into ice hockey, football, photography and
		cooking. I support the Anaheim Ducks and Reading FC, and I reckon I make a
		pretty fantastic mutton curry!
	</p>
</section>